  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to high heat (400°F).",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together lemon juice, olive oil, brown sugar, norwegian seasoning, and garlic powder.",
    "Add the lamb cubes to the marinade and mix well to coat.",
